---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About — Yitae Jeong">
  <div class="max-w-2xl">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs text-blue-800 dark:text-cyan-400 mb-2">ABOUT</p>
    <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-stone-950 dark:text-white mb-6">Yitae Jeong (tteon)</h1>

    <div class="prose-custom">
      <p>
        I am a research engineer at <strong>XCENA</strong> in Seoul working at the intersection of graph processing, ontology-grounded agents, and LLM inference infrastructure (vLLM, KV-cache sharing, and CXL/RDMA memory hierarchies).
      </p>

      <h2>How Experiments Are Logged Here</h2>
      <p>
        Rather than leaving results scattered across terminal logs or cherry-picking wins, every experiment entry declares its hypothesis, falsification condition, environment manifest, and scope boundaries:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Supported</strong>: Measured results satisfy pre-registered criteria cleanly within stated scope limits.</li>
        <li><strong>Refuted</strong>: Hypothesis failed under valid execution conditions.</li>
        <li><strong>Mixed</strong>: Quantified gains in one workload regime alongside statistically clear regressions or costs in another.</li>
        <li><strong>Inconclusive</strong>: Execution failed or lacked baseline parity (infra failures are never reported as passes or rejections).</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 id="seocho">SEOCHO (Separate Documentation Site)</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>SEOCHO</strong> is an ontology-first graph memory framework separating semantic ontology validation, Rust Bolt scheduling, and multi-engine query execution across Neo4j and Postgres backends. Its standalone project documentation lives separately at{' '}
        <a href="https://seocho.blog" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">seocho.blog</a>{' '}
        (<a href="https://github.com/tteon/seocho" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">github.com/tteon/seocho</a>).
      </p>

      <h2>Profiles</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>GitHub: <a href="https://github.com/tteon" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">github.com/tteon</a></li>
        <li>LinkedIn: <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/yitaejeong/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">linkedin.com/in/yitaejeong</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
